  "expertText": "* = $0801\n\n.macro setColor(text_color)\n    LDA #{text_color}\n    JSR $FFD2\n.endm\n\n.const red = $1C\n.const blue = $1F\n\n.set_border $00\n.set_bg $00\n.clear_screen \n\n.charset lower\n.invoke setColor(blue)\n.print \"Hello .print - MACRO test\", lower\n    LDA #$0D\n    JSR $FFD2\n    JSR $FFD2\n\n    LDX #$00\n    LDA $0C00,X\n.invoke setColor(red)\n.while A != #$00\n    JSR $FFD2 ; aktuális PETSCII karakter kiírása\n    INX\n    LDA text_data1,X ; következő karakter betöltése\n.endw\n    RTS\n\n\n\n\n.petscii $0C00, \"This is the .while, .endw MACRO Example!\", lower, null :text_data1",
